os.  He was also the father of John VII.","wp_description":"Byzantine emperor from 1376 to 1379","wikipedia_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andronikos_IV_Palaiologos","image_lead":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/158_-_Andronikos_IV_Palaiologos_%28Mutinensis_-_color%29.png","thumbnail":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/158_-_Andronikos_IV_Palaiologos_%28Mutinensis_-_color%29.png","chat_ready":true,"display_from":1376,"display_to":1379}